	<#bbbbbb>Health: 1400</>
	<#bbbbbb>This move list assumes you are facing to the right.</>
	<#190bd9>UNIQUE TRAIT: ARCHETYPE FALSE</>
	JV can enhance his Special, Remix, and Super Moves by
	dashing forward before using them. The enhanced moves are more powerful
	and have unique properties. JV can also cancel certain moves into
	King's Arsenal, a set of followup attacks.

